WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:31.440
The saved school index contains eleven Week 14 rows: a broad A&P review, BCEHS A01 through A04, BCPEG practical examination criteria, and assignments in CV Patho, CNS, CPSC, FON, MSN, pharmacology, mental-health nursing and vital-sign measurement. The source identity and exact assigned-range status are stated in each reading, rather than treating every recovered file as an unverified candidate.
保存的学校索引列出第十四周十一项阅读：A&P累计复习、BCEHS A01至A04、BCPEG实操考试标准，以及CV Patho、CNS、CPSC、FON、MSN、药理学、精神健康护理和生命体征测量。每份阅读都说明真实来源身份及指定范围的核验情况，不把所有已找回文件笼统当成未核候选。

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:45.744
Nancy is the learner-confirmed main examination textbook. Its selected EENT and clinical-decision sections are an additional study bridge, not a twelfth school reading row and not a translation of the assigned chapters.
Nancy是学习者确认的主考试教材。这里选取眼耳鼻喉和临床决策章节作为额外衔接内容，不是学校第十二项阅读，也不是指定章节的翻译。

00:00:45.744 --> 00:01:10.560
The assignment table identifies the reading requirement; the actual school-folder copy identifies the text that can be checked. Several repeated safety and communication ranges now have verified source identities and earlier full-range explanations. A similar title alone is still insufficient, and a source or page difference remains explicit rather than being silently cleared.
指定阅读表说明学校要求，实际学校文件夹副本则确定可以核读的正文。多项重复安全与沟通阅读，已有核实的来源身份和此前完成的全范围讲解。但标题相似仍不够；来源或页码有差异，必须明确保留，不能悄悄消除。

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:35.808
This workshop uses original paired English and Chinese teaching and retains the exact school locator beside the actual mapping. It does not reproduce source patient stories, figures, assessment questions or answer keys. Review status is tied to the source and teaching evidence, not the number of files, slides or links. Remaining reading gaps are not presented as completed.
本工作坊采用原创中英对照教学，在实际映射旁保留学校的准确定位。它不复制来源病例、图表、评估题或答案。复核状态取决于来源和教学证据，不取决于文件、幻灯片或链接数量；仍有缺口的阅读不能宣称完成。

00:01:35.808 --> 00:01:53.880
For the child airway case, connect respiratory anatomy, pediatric physiology and danger cues; for eye exposure, connect chemical contact, infection-control/PPE and rapid irrigation; for bleeding, connect risk history with a simple first-aid action.
儿童气道案例应联系呼吸解剖、儿童生理和危险线索；眼部暴露应联系化学接触、感染控制/PPE和及时冲洗；鼻出血则把危险因素病史与简单的初步处理联系起来。

00:01:53.880 --> 00:02:08.040
Do not use nursing texts or broad physiology readings as field authorization. Clinical pathways, provincial legislation, current service policy, licensing and supervised instruction define the operative boundary.
不要把护理教材或广泛生理学阅读当作现场操作授权。临床流程、省级法规、现行服务政策、执照和受监督教学共同确定实际执业边界。

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:21.912
For each answer, state the source you used and whether it is a school objective, current BCEHS direction or a candidate-text concept. That habit prevents a textbook summary from being mistaken for a current treatment order.
每个答案都要说明所依据的资料，并指出它属于学校目标、BCEHS现行指导还是候选教材概念。这样可以避免把教材摘要误当成现行治疗指示。

00:02:21.912 --> 00:02:35.808
When studying for a test, distinguish recall from application. Recall the school’s stated criteria; then apply the current source and explain how you would respond if equipment, patient condition or scene safety changed.
备考时应区分记忆与应用：先回忆学校明示标准，再应用现行来源，并解释设备、患者状况或现场安全变化时该如何应对。

00:02:35.808 --> 00:02:54.600
The school plan requests a Sunday self-assessment using Appendix G and three weak points for Week 16 remediation. The official appendix was not present in the available source set. Use the linked original three-gap method only as preparation; do not submit it in place of the school form.
学校计划要求周日使用Appendix G自评，并为第16周补救列出三个弱项。现有资料中未见官方附录。链接中的原创三弱项方法只能用于准备，不要代替学校表格提交。

00:02:54.600 --> 00:03:13.392
A useful gap says what happened, when it happened, why it matters and how the next run will test a different behavior. For example: “I waited for saline while the eye remained exposed; next run I will start suitable clean water while my partner identifies the product.”
有用的弱项说明发生了什么、何时发生、为何重要，以及下一轮如何检验行为改变。例如：“眼睛仍暴露时我等待盐水；下一轮我会先用适当清洁水冲洗，同时由同伴识别产品。”
